      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16623\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16623\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e to enter the addition.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThen press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16624\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16625\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qminus.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16625\u0026quot;,185)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16626\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qnegative.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16626\u0026quot;,189)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16627\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16628\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_16629\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_16629\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives the answer 16, along with a visual representation as shown.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_2_1_integers_5_10/f-10-5-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
